1
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:07,207
(Raj:)Howard's capsule should be
reentering the atmosphere any minute.

2
00:00:07,407 --> 00:00:11,437
- It'll be good to have him back.
- The Fantastic Four, reunited, ha, ha.

3
00:00:12,278 --> 00:00:15,338
(Sheldon:)You had a good run, fake Wolowitz.

4
00:00:16,049 --> 00:00:18,809
(Sheldon:)We'll remember you
with nostalgic fondness...

5
00:00:18,985 --> 00:00:21,145
(Sheldon:)...the way we do the dial-up modem...

6
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:25,584
(Sheldon:)...the VHS tape,
or Leonard's gym membership.

7
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:28,657
(Raj:)We're not kicking him out.

8
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:32,762
(Raj:)- Stuart and I have become good friends.
- Okay, one vote for, one vote against.

9
00:00:32,932 --> 00:00:36,332
(Sheldon:)- Leonard, you're the tiebreaker.
- I don't have a problem with Stuart.

10
00:00:36,503 --> 00:00:39,493
He gives us a 20 percent discount
at his comic book store.

11
00:00:39,973 --> 00:00:42,133
(Sheldon:)Well, I don't sell
my friendship that cheaply.

12
00:00:42,308 --> 00:00:44,678
- I can go 30.
- Welcome aboard, old chum.

13
00:00:46,379 --> 00:00:50,749
Okay, the NASA website says
Howard's final descent has begun.

14
00:00:51,785 --> 00:00:53,445
(Sheldon:)He left a boy.

15
00:00:53,653 --> 00:00:57,113
(Sheldon:)He returns a boy-sized hero.

16
00:01:01,528 --> 00:01:02,958
(Dimitri:)Loops, calm down!

17
00:01:08,735 --> 00:01:11,605
- What's that?
- The Jewish prayer for eating bread!

18
00:01:13,173 --> 00:01:16,333
(Howard:)We don't have one
for falling out of space!

19
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:21,934
(Howard:)We did it.

20
00:01:22,949 --> 00:01:25,349
(Howard:)We're on the ground.
We survived!

21
00:01:26,152 --> 00:01:27,672
(Mike:)That was just the parachute.

22
00:01:27,854 --> 00:01:36,024
(Mike:)We still have another six miles to go.

